## Summary of Changes (PRD-12 Deliverable 5.4)

### Files Modified

**`crates/polkagent-plugin/src/error.rs`** — Added 5 new error variants:
- `SignatureVerificationFailed` — cosign signature invalid or missing
- `UnsignedPackageRejected` — unsigned package rejected by policy
- `SlsaAttestationFailed` — SLSA provenance missing or below required level
- `SandboxDenied` — WASM host-call denied at sandbox boundary
- `SandboxResourceExhausted` — fuel/memory/timeout exhausted

**`crates/polkagent-plugin/src/manifest.rs`** — Added:
- `ProvenanceSection` — cosign_bundle, signer_identity, rekor_log_index, slsa_provenance, slsa_build_level, content_digest
- `TrustTier` enum — Unsigned → Signed → Verified → Curated (per PRD-12 §4.7.1)
- `SandboxTier` enum — ContextOnly / Process / Wasm / Container (per PRD-12 §8.2)
- `PluginManifest::trust_tier()`, `sandbox_tier()`, `is_signed()` methods

**`crates/polkagent-plugin/src/sandbox.rs`** — Added alongside existing `PluginSandbox`:
- `SandboxResourceLimits` — fuel budget, memory cap, timeout, network/fs limits (PRD-12 §8.4 defaults)
- `SandboxConfig` — tier + granted capabilities + resource limits + allowed hosts
- `WasmtimeSandbox` — Wasmtime Component Model sandbox that:
  - Gates host-calls by checking granted capabilities at the WIT boundary
  - Filters HTTP requests against allowed host patterns (wildcard support)
  - Tracks per-plugin resource limits (fuel, memory, timeout)
  - Denies any operation not in the plugin's declared capabilities

**`crates/polkagent-plugin/src/lib.rs`** — Updated `PluginManager` to include:
- `WasmtimeSandbox` for WASM-tier plugins
- `PackageVerifier` for cosign signature checking
- `AttestationChecker` for SLSA attestation
- `load_plugins_verified()` — full supply-chain verification before registration
- `permissive()` constructor for dev/sideload workflows
- `check_host_call()` for WASM boundary enforcement

### Files Created

**`crates/polkagent-plugin/src/verification.rs`** — Cosign v3 keyless signature verification:
- `VerificationPolicy` — allow_unsigned, minimum_trust_tier, pinned_identities
- `PackageVerifier` — strict (rejects unsigned) and permissive modes
- Signer identity pinning enforcement
- `VerificationResult` with warnings

**`crates/polkagent-plugin/src/attestation.rs`** — SLSA Build L2 attestation checking:
- `SlsaBuildLevel` enum — None / L1 / L2 / L3
- `AttestationPolicy` — require_attestation, minimum_build_level
- `AttestationChecker` — strict (requires L2) and permissive modes
- Content digest presence checking

### Test Results

**138 unit tests pass** + 1 doc-test, covering:
- Unsigned package rejection (strict mode)
- Signed/verified package acceptance
- Signer identity pinning enforcement
- SLSA L2 attestation requirement
- WasmtimeSandbox host-call capability gating
- HTTP host filtering with wildcards
- Resource limit defaults
- Trust tier ordering and sandbox tier selection
- Full `PluginManager` integration tests with verified loading
